{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is &quot;Love Starts Again&quot;?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A live-action romance adventure with high-definition images that unfold from the protagonist's perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you become the protagonist and make choices to change the future, you will become embroiled in dramatic romances with the heroines. A realistic romance simulation filled with situations that everyone dreams of experiencing at least once.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story of carving out the future with six heroines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is Tokyo. Working at a black company.<br>One day, he collapses from overwork.<br>When he wakes up, he's in the room he lived in in the past.<br>As he tries to change the future,<br>he gets caught up in a dramatic love affair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Heroines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Azusa: #Friend #Cheerful #Honest #ESFJ<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras/b87117e2ee8b0155df6c451f01b8a2ba.avif?t=1761293185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras_big/b87117e2ee8b0155df6c451f01b8a2ba.avif?t=1761293185 width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kasumi: #Childhood friend #Unrequited love #Jealousy #ENFP<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras/fc5fbc30bfb04ef2f247f3e267e6f7b1.avif?t=1761293185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras_big/fc5fbc30bfb04ef2f247f3e267e6f7b1.avif?t=1761293185 width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuki: #Junior #Lady #Innocent #INTP<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar