rience in Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Various choices and multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Shakespeare's work states, &quot;Life is a series of choices,&quot; you will be forced to make choices that seem like everyday choices. A single response can change the future...<br>Not only that, but a variety of choices will unfold that can lead to humor, seriousness, horror, suspense, and mysterious endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6A thorough commitment to realism</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scenario that seems like it could happen on the edge of reality, where everyone has thought, &quot;I want to go back to those days...&quot; and fantasies. Communication through chat and short videos. We've stuck to realism to create a sense of immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you see the ending with the heroine, you will surely think: <br>&quot;Love starts again.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Love Starts Again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707370/7956e4a97b5e5e82a5fb12f61a2247e7dfa5062c.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Thinking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707370/cdd3dd3b483a7959de7de473941897811d61a43f.jpg"},{"name":"Punching Bag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707370/66998a798dac97f91cb321b467648da162ce9f27.jpg"},{"name":"Lose Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707370/cdd3dd3b483a7959de7de473941897811d61a43f.jpg"},{"name":"Zero-Point Gag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707370/cdd3dd3b483a7959de7de473941897811d61a43f.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Past Exposed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3707370/5ef4058e8a1b2e60bf85655c39f276de220e0c70.jpg"},{"name":"Affirming Humility","pat